I like to find a large box (or bag or chest if I'm desperate) and
leave it on level 3/4 in the very early game and fill it with
basically everything except usefull wands (easy to ID), some sort of
ranged weapon(s), a couple of food rations, a vegeterian corpse, any
armour and any usefull tools (Uni horn, Magic whistle).  Since potions
aren't usually I'd in the early game I leave them in the box.  If I
have managed to ID a scroll of earth (sokoban or monster) or teleport
(monster, closet) I like to keep one of them on.  As soon as I find an
altar (preferabbly level 5-10) I (carefully) shift my stash to it.




